.TH SIGNF 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
signf \- Sign of v as a float: 1 for positive, \-1 for negative, 0 for zero
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqmathx.h\(dq
.BI "float signf(float v);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Sign of v as a float: 1 for positive, \-1 for negative, 0 for zero. Facing direction from a velocity, or which way to apply friction.
.PP
This is a static inline function; it is defined in the header.
.SH RETURN VALUE
\-1, 0 or 1.
.SH MODULE
math (src/engine/math/mathx.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR clampf (3),
.BR gge\-api (7),
.BR gge (1)
